<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-3699] CreatedExpiryPolicy doesn&apos;t work if entry is loaded from store</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3699</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;According to JCache spec, &lt;tt&gt;ExpiryPolicy.getExpiryForCreation()&lt;/tt&gt; must be triggered on &lt;tt&gt;get()&lt;/tt&gt; operation if the entry is loaded from the store. Currently this is not happening.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test reproducing the issue is attached.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
